eat my car accident back injury while living with a roommate at 34.", "author": "BobbyHill221", "created": 1792068334183, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "CleanUpPhillyTrump24", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Peripheral EBT benefits need to be cut", "last_comment_created": 1792074307743, "content": "<p>I just saw on a clip that people on EBT can get discounted entry to zoos. That shit needs to stop, and anything like it. Any entertainment discount or any other discount not related to store-brand staple foods needs to be cut.<br />\nI'm sure many of these discounts are offered by states, and the federal government should threaten the cutoff of federal funding contingent on ending all such discounts for EBT users in such cases.<br />\nI'm so sick of seeing leeches have an easier time of things while I work full time and can't even afford company health insurance or to treat my car accident back injury while living with a roommate at 34.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 9, "score_up": 40, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVezlwNd", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 63, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8887109, "raw_content": "", "author": "rdvs34283", "created": 1792059404343, "profile_picture": "p9HQtdiLq2uP", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Franklymydear", "is_video